%% Basket optimization (basket-level economics)
flowchart TD
    RB[Ranked offers per item] --> PM[Per marketplace: pick best offer per item]
    PM --> PR["Price basket: items + estimate_fees(subtotal)"]
    PR --> CH{Choose best per objective}
    CH --> BUD{Within hard budget?}
    BUD -- yes --> OK[Basket ready]
    BUD -- no --> RE[Re-optimize CHEAPEST across all marketplaces]
    RE --> BUD2{Fits budget?}
    BUD2 -- yes --> OK
    BUD2 -- no --> DROP[Drop optional items]
    DROP --> BUD3{Fits budget?}
    BUD3 -- yes --> OK
    BUD3 -- no --> REV[within_budget=false -> USER_REVIEW_REQUIRED]
